# cortex-ia workflow

- Target: `windsurf`
- Profile: `portable-sequential`
- Workflow semantic ID: `workflow/portable-review`

## Portable roles
- `role/implement`: Implement one bounded vertical work unit.
- `role/validate`: Independently verify contract outcomes.

## Portable phases
- `phase/apply` -> `role/implement`; depends on: none
- `phase/verify` -> `role/validate`; depends on: `phase/apply`

## Semantic tools
- `tool/forgespec-task` (required: true)

## Trust boundaries
- `repository_data`
- `trusted_policy`

## Permission ceiling
- `filesystem/read`
- `filesystem/write`
- `mcp/forgespec`

## Capability disclosures
- `approval/destructive`: state=advisory; substitution=none; enforcement=prompt; guarantee=best-effort; added=none; removed=none; reason=Windsurf can express approval only as prompt guidance
- `coordination/task-claim`: state=emulated; substitution=`service/forgespec-claim`; enforcement=mcp; guarantee=equivalent; added=`mcp/forgespec`; removed=none; reason=ForgeSpec remains task authority
